    {
      "answer_type": "single_choice",
      "rule_group": "三值代入·背景提取维",
      "stem": "第20周末检查：挣值 BCWP=6370 万元、已完成实际成本 ACWP=6240 万元、计划值 BCWS=5340 万元。下列把三值放入指标公式，哪一组位置正确？",
      "model_answer": "CV=BCWP−ACWP=6370−6240；SV=BCWP−BCWS=6370−5340，三值各归其位不互换。",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "CV=BCWP−ACWP=6370−6240、SV=BCWP−BCWS=6370−5340，三值按定义各归其位。",
          "is_correct": true,
          "source_error_code": "",
          "temptation": "",
          "loss_reason": "",
          "fix": "BCWP 恒作被减数/分子，ACWP 配成本、BCWS 配进度，位置不互换。",
          "option_id": "E05-html-practice-html-q3-a27747a1aaaf:option-1"
        },
        {
          "text": "CV=ACWP−BCWP=6240−6370、SV=BCWS−BCWP=5340−6370，用实际/计划减挣值。",
          "is_correct": false,
          "source_error_code": "E09",
          "temptation": "记成「实际减挣值」，被减数减数顺序反了。",
          "loss_reason": "被减数减数颠倒会让 CV=−130、SV=−1030，方向整个判反成超支延误。",
          "fix": "CV=BCWP−ACWP、SV=BCWP−BCWS，挣值 BCWP 永远作被减数。",
          "option_id": "E05-html-practice-html-q3-a27747a1aaaf:option-2"
        },
        {
          "text": "CV=BCWP−BCWS=6370−5340、SV=BCWP−ACWP=6370−6240，成本用计划、进度用实际。",
          "is_correct": false,
          "source_error_code": "E07",
          "temptation": "记得都用 BCWP 减，却把 ACWP 和 BCWS 的分工调换了。",
          "loss_reason": "成本偏差要减实际 ACWP、进度偏差要减计划 BCWS；两者互换后 CV/SV 全错。",
          "fix": "成本 CV 减 ACWP、进度 SV 减 BCWS，别把两个减数换位置。",
          "option_id": "E05-html-practice-html-q3-a27747a1aaaf:option-3"
        },
        {
          "text": "把 BCWS 与 ACWP 互换代入：CV=BCWP−BCWS、CPI=BCWP/BCWS，成本一律配计划值。",
          "is_correct": false,
          "source_error_code": "E08",
          "temptation": "题干数字多，没读清哪个是实际、哪个是计划就代入。",
          "loss_reason": "BCWS(计划)与 ACWP(实际)互换，成本侧四指标系统性全错。",
          "fix": "先认清 ACWP=实际、BCWS=计划；成本侧一律用 ACWP。",
          "option_id": "E05-html-practice-html-q3-a27747a1aaaf:option-4"
        }
      ],
